# Binance AlphaPilot 🚀

## AI Crypto Research & Risk Agent

Binance AlphaPilot is an AI-agent workflow designed for the
Binance Agent OS Mini Hackathon.

It combines market intelligence, explainable research,
portfolio risk analysis and human-approved actions.

---

## Features

- 📊 Binance market data
- 🤖 AI-agent workflow
- 🔎 Explainable market research
- 🛡️ Portfolio risk analysis
- 📈 Strategy hypothesis generation
- 👤 Human approval before consequential actions

---

## Architecture

User
↓
